Admires [[Ab'Dendriel]] very much. 

Charles also offers shortcuts to a few destinations which are cheaper. However, you might get shipwrecked and end up in a different place when using them:
* An island west of the [[Meluna]], {{Mapper Coords|text=here|125.24|126.205|7|2|1|0.50.5}}, as part of [[The Secret Library Quest]]. After using the ship's telescope (during night) and getting the [[Hawser (Item)]] from the heap of rubbish, use the hawser on the raft and you will get sent to [[Fibula]].
* A small island, part of the [[Ice Islands]], {{Mapper Coords|text=here|125.113|123.254|7|2|1|0.50.5}}, where you can find [[Arctic Faun]]s. You can leave the island through the [[Ice Portal]], which brings you to [[Vega]], north of [[Carlin]], north of [[Thais]], [[Fibula]] or the south shore of [[Ragnir]].
* A small island north of Feyrist, {{Mapper Coords|text=here|130.182|125.159|7|2|1|0.50.5}}, where you can face [[Raxias]] when going in the teleporter. You get sent to [[Carlin]]'s temple after using the [[Energy Shrine]] there.
* A small island in the middle of the three [[Laguna Islands]], {{Mapper Coords|text=here|126.200|128.170|7|4|1|0.250.25}}. You will find a dead human. Use it to gain a [[shovel]]. You can use that shovel on a [[hole]] next to it. Below, you find a small cave with a [[seashell]] and a dead explorer, in which you can find a [[Fishing Rod]]. There is some water inside the cave where you can fish in. You can leave this island by walking on the [[turtle]], which will bring you to [[Meriana]]. If you don't have access to [[Meriana]] yet, you will need to have a fish in your backpack for the turtle, which you can loot from the crab on the island or catch with the fishing rod and worms. Worms can be dug up from the sand by using the shovel.

After shipwrecking on one of these locations, you cannot use the shortcut from Charles for 20 hours.
